<https://potato-hamlet.example/ontology/paper/bob-7> a ph:Sheet ;
  ph:ownedBy <https://potato-hamlet.example/ontology/citizen/bob> .

<https://potato-hamlet.example/ontology/paper/cara-1> a ph:Sheet ;
