# The instrument, typed by the QUALIFICATION it has rather than by a kind
# of thing. No law text says "with a pen" -- each says to write and leaves
# the instrument open, so a hamlet stocked only with some other inscriptible
# thing satisfies `prepare`, and one stocked with nothing inscriptible is
# refused.

<https://potato-hamlet.example/ontology/instrument/authority>
  a ph:Inscriptible ;
  ph:label "The authority's writing instrument" .
